dsh-prompt-customizer README · What it is：A [DeepSeek Harness](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness) (dsh) plugin. It adds an independent "Capabilities" panel to the sidebar that brings three otherwise configuration-heavy jobs into one visual surface:

- **Prompt customization**: block, replace, inject and reorder system-prompt sections by name;
- **Skill collection management**: import, group and toggle skills;
- **MCP server integration**: add MCP servers and apply preset-level or tool-level masking.
